|                    U.S. GOVERNMENT INFORMATION SYSTEM                   |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------+

You are accessing a U.S. Government information system, which includes
this computer, its network, all computers connected to this network, and
all devices and storage media attached to this network or to any computer
on this network. This system is provided for authorized use only.

This information system processes CONTROLLED UNCLASSIFIED INFORMATION (CUI)
and is protected in accordance with NIST SP 800-171r3.

By using this system, you consent to the following conditions:

  - The organization routinely intercepts, monitors, records, audits, and
    discloses communications and data transiting or stored on this system
    for any lawful purpose, including penetration testing, monitoring,
    network operations, and law enforcement investigations.

  - At any time, and for any lawful purpose, the organization may inspect
    and seize data stored on this system.

  - Communications and data transiting or stored on this system are not
    private, are subject to routine monitoring and disclosure, and may be
    used or disclosed for any lawful purpose.

  - You have NO reasonable expectation of privacy regarding any use of
    this system or any data on it.

  - Unauthorized or improper use of this system may result in disciplinary
    action, and civil and criminal penalties.

  - CUI must be handled, stored, and transmitted only as authorized. Do not
    remove CUI from this system without explicit authorization.

Unauthorized access is prohibited and is subject to prosecution under
18 U.S.C. 1030. If you do not consent to these conditions, LOG OFF NOW.

